+## JSON Patch (RFC 6902)
+
+`applyPatch(document, patch)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, applies a JSON Patch (an array of `add`,
+`remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy` and `test` operations) and returns the result as a new value; the
+input document and the patch are never mutated or aliased. It throws an `Error` if the patch is invalid
